WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.440
APRIL 4, 2010

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.230
He's late.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.730
Hey!

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.980
Ran, stop right there!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.230
Like I'd ever stop.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.860
Kunai, sorry to make you wait.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.990
Jailbreak!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.410
Ran, you did that, didn't you?

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.160
What did you do?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:27.250
I just threw a bomb at the ceiling. Boom!

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.040
Sheesh, again?

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.800
There.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.550
I love the view from here.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.930
How's kindergarten?

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:41.140
Boring. I like that they feed me, though.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
You should come back to the Pylon Apartment.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.600
Your dad who kept punching you
got arrested, right?

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.230
Serves him right.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.320
But that sounds good, too.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:59.580
Whoa, that looks so cool.
Isn't that 0th's graffiti?

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.000
A global artist originally from the 24th Ward.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:05.120
I heard he's back here right now.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.420
Seriously? That's so wicked.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.750
But what does that say?

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.800
It says, "Every act of Creation
is an act of Destruction."

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.010
So you like my graffiti?

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.190
There is only one way to stop the crime.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.070
Will you snipe the perpetrator and kill him
to stop the ship from exploding?

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:02.360
Or will you let the perpetrator go and allow
many people to die from the exploding ship?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.580
Guide the future.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.000
<i>The terrorist who was shot dead.</i>

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:10.080
AUGUST 5, 2021

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.790
<i>That was Kunai.</i>

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.250
Another trolley dilemma.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:18.260
Yeah. But there's no room for debate
concerning this future.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.680
I can't abandon innocent victims
and succumb to terrorism.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.260
You're right, but...

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.850
<i>Why is Kunai a terrorist? This makes no sense.</i>

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.850
Then what exactly is Carneades after?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.600
I'm wondering about that too,

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.180
but the most important thing right now
is to prevent the explosion.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.980
The explosion will happen
in a casino on a luxury liner.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.940
The clock was showing 21:24.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.440
In other words, that's our time limit.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.860
We have to capture the terrorist before that.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.780
What if we carelessly aggravate him
and activates the remote detonation?

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.910
A third path incurs too high a risk.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:47.200
But shooting to kill...

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.500
There's absolutely no need
to sympathize with terrorists.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.290
Do you remember which monorail station
we saw from the Vision?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.750
- No.
- It was too dark.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.340
It was hard to discern,
but it was Nihama Station.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.590
I remember it well
because I "bombed" it before.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.220
So that means

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:08.060
we can pinpoint which train the culprit
will be arriving from based on the time of 21:24.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.310
Indeed, we can.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.900
Ran, I have a favor to ask.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.440
Okay. What is it, Ko?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.900
20:15

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.400
<i>There was a bomb threat targeting WINNER'S.</i>

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.820
<i>Please evacuate all passengers immediately.</i>

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.070
This ship is personally owned
by Mr. Howard Win.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.080
Furthermore, they've invited many VIPs
to this party tonight.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.040
I don't care if you're SARG or not,
but your laws do not apply here.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.500
How brusque.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.040
It was no use.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:43.090
We can't get enough information without
being directly able to observe the target.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:46.760
<i>I see. Should I erase the fake criminal threat?</i>

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.340
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.470
- The command?
- They said don't publicly release the threat.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.800
No. Leave it alone, please.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.390
- We need to get ready right away.
- Okay.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.390
<i>But it's a fake threat.</i>

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.770
We need it to mobilize SARG.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.440
<i>- Okay.
- I see.</i>

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.770
Then, here's my own report.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.940
20:16

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.110
I'll go board WINNER'S right now.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:03.030
<i>What? Why are you doing that
without consulting us?</i>

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.910
It's kinda infuriating having to choose between
two choices that Carneades prepared for us.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.780
<i>You don't even know what kind of bomb it is.</i>

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.160
I'll think about it after I get on board.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:14.660
Is that...

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.290
Tarki?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.670
<i>Shu's actions give me an advantage.</i>

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.050
<i>The chances of changing the future
has gone up.</i>

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.380
20:38

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.970
<i>What has driven Kunai
into becoming a terrorist?</i>

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.440
How's this, instructor?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.770
MAY 14, 2010

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:43.150
Very good. Is DoRed your tagging name?

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.280
Not mine, but ours.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.860
The "Red" in DoRed is me,
and "Do" is from Kunai.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.120
Huh? Me?

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.280
Kunai is Naito Kudo.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:54.750
The "Do" in DoRed is from KuDO.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.290
Kudo's "Do."

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.050
Do you want to become better at drawing?

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:16.430
It's impossible for me.
I don't have talent like Ran.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:21.270
Hey, why do you think I make an effort
to draw in the middle of the city?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.690
I don't know. Why?

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.400
It's because I want to be involved with the world,
and influence it in some fashion.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:29.780
Influence.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.870
I want everyone to know my train of thought.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:39.370
If the world can be a better place and everyone
can smile as a result, wouldn't that be the best?

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.130
The method doesn't matter.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.840
Hey, Kunai.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.470
You haven't been hanging out lately.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.680
Let's go "bombing" together.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:55.890
Sure.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.810
But we'll do it my way.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.520
There are passengers aboard.
This is gonna be hard.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.690
No problems.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.860
This is how I do things.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.690
Kunai? What are you talking about?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.860
They hid my game console.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.950
Kunai, did you do this?

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.960
That's so awesome!
Teach me how to do it, too.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.960
Yeah, sure thing.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:28.800
<i>I thought this could be my weapon
so that I could stay as his equal.</i>

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.300
<i>Hacking was the only thing I had.</i>

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.140
<i>But he surpassed me in no time.</i>

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.270
Ran.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.320
<i>I don't have the right to be here anymore.</i>

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:53.740
<i>The least I could do is draw the line
using something I'm capable of doing.</i>

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.410
I didn't think he'd be here, but...

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.450
Yes? Give me a minute.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.910
20:42

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.170
Oh? Welcome home, Kunai.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.790
Grandma Kunai. It's been a while.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.590
You went out on a walk again?

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.720
I was worried because you were out so late.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.180
<i>Grandma's dementia has gotten worse.</i>

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.350
Damn it, I can't find him
through computer searches.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.020
Kunai, where the hell are you right now?

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.310
<i>A bomb isn't how you do things, right?</i>

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.530
An uncovered hard drive.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.650
This paper...

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.530
"I am a sinful criminal."

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.160
Criminal?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:42.660
Kunai, this thing you gave me is really good.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:48.040
When I'm listening to it, the pain
in my feet goes away, and I feel a lot better.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.300
It's really marvelous.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.670
Grandma, can I borrow that for a sec?

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.090
This is Di-VA, the music app Kunai developed.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.220
If I recall, it used a biometric sensor.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:05.190
Bingo. The data that's in the current release
has been modified.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:11.820
<i>Criminal... Sinful... Di-VA... Di-VA... D...</i>

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:12.820
<i>D.</i>

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:16.030
<i>So that's what it is?</i>

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.660
<i>But why would you be
behind the creation of Drug D?</i>

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.830
Wait. The company distributing Di-VA...

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.660
THE INNOVATION TO CONNECT PEOPLE TO THE NEW AGE

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.830
KABURAYA Corporation was, if I recall...

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.330
Tarki.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:33.920
It's all coming together now.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.340
<i>Welcome to WINNER'S.</i>

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.680
<i>Today is a memorable day.</i>

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:47.350
<i>This project will redevelop Shantytown,
create many new jobs, and revitalize the area.</i>

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.310
<i>Now, let's all begin with a celebration together.</i>

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.360
<i>Cheers.</i>

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.360
Cheers!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.150
This guy sounds so fishy.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.280
<i>Shuta.</i>

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:01.200
I found out that 500 grams of C4
was stolen from an army warehouse.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.500
That amount is consistent with the scale
of the explosion we saw in the Vision.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.830
<i>I'm guessing that's the explosive.
I sent you an image.</i>

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.710
Oh, I've seen these in movies.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.420
It's one of those
"cut the red wire or blue wire," right?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.220
Shu, you said Tarki was there, right?

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.970
Can you see if he's carrying a hard drive?

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.350
A hard drive?

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.180
<i>I saw him carrying a box of a similar size.</i>

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.180
Bingo. That's the bomb.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.520
<i>- Seriously?
- How do you know?</i>

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.850
Here you go. Thanks. You can have it back.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.020
<i>Is our perp Tarki?</i>

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.020
Have you had enough?

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.150
No, it's not. I don't know who the perp is.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.950
<i>Oh, we don't have much time left.
Ko, hurry up to the station.</i>

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.450
Nihama Station for the monorails, right?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.080
Kunai, are you heading out?

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.410
Yeah. I'll be right back.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.290
<i>I'll make sure to bring Kunai back.</i>

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.750
Ms. Shishido, I have a favor to ask.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.670
Wh-What's up?
You don't need to bow like that.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.210
<i>Beating around the bush won't work with her.</i>

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:01.890
If you listen to me, you can prevent
that terrorist attack from the criminal threat.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.720
- What was that?
- Huh? Koki, that means...

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.430
Senpai's out right now, so it's a tough call.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.730
But we don't have time. Let's hear it.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.690
<i>The pieces of the solution were so close by.</i>

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.320
<i>A shell company
that can be ditched at anytime.</i>

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.610
<i>Come to think of it,
I haven't seen Kunai in a while.</i>

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:21.240
<i>The spike in crime rates in Shantytown.</i>

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:25.240
<i>No pills, no powders,
no plants, no liquids. Nothing.</i>

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.240
<i>The contents of the Di-VA updates.</i>

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:31.540
Huh? The elevator moves?
When was it fixed?

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.920
<i>The unnaturally high amounts of money
deposited into Kunai's account.</i>

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.300
<i>No, even without that...</i>

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.380
<i>It's nothing. The same as always.</i>

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.140
<i>The answer was right there in front of me.</i>

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.300
<i>Kunai.</i>

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.720
<i>You aren't a criminal at all.</i>

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.310
You're merely a victim of all those filthy adults.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:58.030
Kunai, what are you developing this time?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.150
Di-VA.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.490
A female singer?

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:05.320
It's an automatic music generator app
that uses cPhone's biometric sensor.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.450
The sensor reads the user's physical condition,

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:13.420
and creates healing music
most fit for their current biorhythm.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.080
That's amazing. I don't get it at all.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.330
It's already available in the store.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.000
- What? You should've let us know sooner.
- Let's see.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.760
Wow. It has super high ratings.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.590
I'll download it right away.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.970
- I'll download it too.
- But isn't that dangerous?

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.010
Why?

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:29.060
Because if you can heal people through music,
you can hurt them as well, yeah?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:34.900
Such data analysis would be impossible
with cPhone's processing powers.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.860
Ran really hit the mark so quickly.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.360
But Ran is right.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:48.990
This becomes a dangerous item
depending on how you use it.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.250
Should I stop distributing it?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.040
Nice to meet you.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:59.670
You must be Naito Kudo,
the genius programmer?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.630
This is who I am.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.630
KABURAYA CORPORATION CEO
HAJIME TAKI

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.430
Di-VA is a truly wonderful app.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.640
It fully utilizes cPhone's biometric sensor.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.520
I believe it is a form of art.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:16.650
My company has dealings
with Suido Zaibatsu as well.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:21.320
We're thinking of having Di-VA
as one of the default apps for cPhone.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:25.780
And to do that, I would like to officially
purchase the rights for it.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.950
Of course, we will pay you
an adequate sum of money for it.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.370
My app will be
on every single cPhone out there.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.290
No, but it's...

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.790
That's right. I heard that your grandmother
is suffering from a bit of dementia.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.290
Oh, Grandma.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:42.050
And she also has bad legs.
It must be hard with the elevators being broken.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.920
Elevators are part of our business as well.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.300
I'm sure I can be of help to you.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.320
Someone fell down!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.610
Who is this?

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.620
Di-VA?

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:14.370
No, but before that,
I think I saw something similar.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.670
They modified the app that I made?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:20.830
This is...

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:26.420
If you add the code called Vape
that you buy here, you enter Dark Mode?

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:31.220
The data gathered with cPhone's biometric sensor
gets uploaded to the cloud...

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.720
This is crazy.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:42.020
If you listen to this directly, your reasoning
will be destroyed from all the beta-endorphins.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.440
This is a drug with no physical substance.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.820
Hey, Ran, I have to talk...

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.450
Hey Yamamori, what's wrong?

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.330
Please let him be.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:01.130
I heard that his nephew
passed away because of Drug D.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:04.090
D? You mean that drug
that's been getting around lately?

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.010
I won't allow it.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:12.510
Who the hell is violating our city
with this crappy drug?

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.930
I'll make sure to catch that guy.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:15.970
- Yeah.
- You got it.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:20.480
The sharp increase in crime rate
and Di-VA's modification update.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.650
The timing lines up perfectly.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.280
It's because of me that so many people died.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.610
N-No, I was deceived.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.120
All right, I'm inside Taki's PC now.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:38.370
It's because he tricked me
with so much money. It wasn't my intention.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.870
Howard Win?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:45.000
That guy who wants to destroy Shantytown
and create a casino in its wake?

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:49.840
I get it. Howard was looking for an excuse
to redevelop the area into a resort.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:54.010
The sharp increase in crime rate would be
a great excuse to delve into redevelopment.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:59.020
That means Taki bought out Di-VA
with full intention from the beginning to modify it.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.890
It's completely my fault.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.730
It's because I sold it
without thinking about alternatives.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.650
I really need to tell Ran.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:08.980
Tell...

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.490
Can I tell him?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:16.330
I can't rely on him after all this.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:20.330
I don't have the right to rely on him.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.370
I can't rely on him.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:38.600
That's right, if Ran is an artist...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:55.360
Unable to become an artist,
This is the best bomb I've made as a criminal.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.320
I hope you get a good taste of it.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:05.420
If you use the neural network that's in here,
the effects will double.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.630
For you to bring me an improvement
at this timing...

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:12.970
It seems you got a taste
of various naughty things.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.300
The reception party
that will take place aboard WINNER'S.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:23.060
Taki should be handing the hard drive
directly to Howard there.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:28.440
Just a little more before I can
blow up everything that agonizes me

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.440
and the entire city.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.240
By the way, where did Mr. Chikushi go?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.610
Senpai is guarding the mayor.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.280
I hear it's a top-secret meeting
with the governor of Tokyo.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.330
<i>Top secret?</i>

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:44.750
I wonder in what direction
will your father guide the 24th Ward?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.880
This is SARG! We appreciate your cooperation
for this investigation.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.340
- Huh? What?
- Some kind of incident?

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:54.880
<i>I can't confirm the suspect
nor an explosives reaction.</i>

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.470
<i>Just as I thought.</i>

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.890
<i>In the first place,
there was no monorail arriving at 21:24.</i>

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.890
<i>You fooled me. You mislead me.
What are you after, Ran?</i>

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.850
Koki, our tracking target has stopped moving.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.440
Please head over.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.280
<i>Muting the mic.</i>

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.950
Kunai. You're there, aren't you?

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.620
Okay, if you're not going to reply,
I'll just barge in.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.460
Sheesh, what are you doing in a place like this?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.670
Kunai?

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:32.130
I'm surprised you found me, Ran.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:36.300
Though, I had a vague notion
that you'd come here.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.680
Drug D. Kunai, you...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.010
Do you remember this particular train?

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:46.270
Well, 0th ascended simple graffiti into art.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:51.940
Because it was drawn by 0th, scribbles that
would've been erased has been preserved to this day.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.900
This was where
you made your first hacking-bomb.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:59.530
You mean this piece of child's play?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:06.950
Even if I had these skills, if I can't use it properly,
then I'm nothing more than a criminal.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.790
That's not true. Kunai, you're not a criminal.
You're a victim, aren't you?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:15.800
Repeating stuff like this won't impress anyone.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.840
That's not true. You've always impressed me.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:21.010
That's why I kept going as DoRed with you.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.510
Enough of the lip service.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.270
I don't have any time left, damn it.

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.350
He's just not letting himself be alone.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.520
I have to take my chances and go for it.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.740
What’s the matter?

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.000
Sorry to cause such a riot.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.080
It seems that a burglar
who wants this has infiltrated the vessel.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.960
What? Capture him at any cost.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.960
<i>Shuta. Stop what you're doing.</i>

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.220
<i>You need to get out of there somehow.</i>

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.470
- Wait, what do you mean?
- I can't help you if you get caught.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.550
Don't let him get away.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.220
Damn it, what's up with Koki?

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.730
You're fully aware of everything, too.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.230
The people aboard that ship
are all good-for-nothings.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.980
No matter how many people die
because of Drug D,

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.110
they don't care
as long as their own desires are fulfilled.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.570
What's wrong with killing them all,
starting with Howard?

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.370
This isn't how we do things, is it?

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:35.790
I'm sure your art will someday
change the hearts of people all over the world.

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:38.500
But right now, there isn't enough time.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:42.630
You see it really well once you use Drug D.
This thing is dangerous.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:48.140
It blows away all reason. Anger and ecstasy
start welling up from deep within you.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.890
But because of it,
I figured out what I needed to do.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:57.190
Before things get out of hand, I'll do something
that I can't do as an artist, but as a criminal.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:58.770
That's not it. You're...

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:00.440
This is...

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.990
...how I do things!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:03.820
Shoot.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.960
Kunai!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.710
Kunai...

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:23.670
Kunai.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.430
<i>There's no room for choice
concerning this issue.</i>

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.350
Ko?

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:32.520
No matter who that is,
I can't protect criminals.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:34.560
Criminal?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.980
Who's the real criminal?

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:43.320
Kunai's feelings, his hesitation,
his agony, his life.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.990
None of them have any value?
Is that what you want to say?

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:49.580
<i>There's no room for debate.
Don't resist.</i>

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.250
Don't...

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:03.510
You are an artist, Ran.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.670
Kunai.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.090
Freeze.

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:20.980
A BOMB THREAT
ON THE CASINO KING'S SHIP

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:20.980
<i>So the incident ended
with the suspect shot dead, huh?</i>

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:25.440
<i>It seems like it was the right answer,
but why don't I feel relieved?</i>

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>I can't contact either of them right now, too.
What the hell is going on?</i>

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.490
- Man, muscle cramps suck.
- Big Brother Shu.

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:32.660
Hey, Kozue.

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:34.040
Look. Look at this.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:38.170
"My father's memories
drawn by DoRed.”

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:39.500
What do you think?

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:40.500
You wrote this?

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:47.880
Because you said that it's not meaningless,
I thought I should properly write about my dad.

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:52.810
A kind person taught me
that art can change the world.

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:55.810
Maybe things will really change.

00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:58.980
Yeah, you're right.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.970
Koki contributed to preventing terrorism?

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:37.770
Thank you for the report.

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:41.270
I guess it's about time.

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:46.610
Yes?

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:48.940
<i>It's me. Are all the preparations complete?</i>

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:50.450
With no hitches.

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.240
Then you will be starting it?

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:58.750
<i>Yes. By putting KANAE System into full operation,
I will create a revolution within the 24th Ward.</i>
